    },
    {
      "id": "m06-bt-0067",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 868,
      "y": 396.875,
      "width": 464,
      "height": 146.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7B1FA2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 101139,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 101139,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788018447123,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hard rules\n\u2022 No repository layer. No mapper layer. Do not introduce.\n\u2022 Ownership usually in services; OwnershipGuard exists\n  and is used on some post mutations.\n\u2022 EventEmitter2 is in-process\n  (notification.create, media.delete_batch,\n  payment.live_gift_completed)\n  \u2014 NOT a domain event bus / not EventEmitter\n  as architecture between modules.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "m06-b-0066",
      "originalText": "Hard rules\n\u2022 No repository layer. No mapper layer. Do not introduce.\n\u2022 Ownership usually in services; OwnershipGuard exists\n  and is used on some post mutations.\n\u2022 EventEmitter2 is in-process\n  (notification.create, media.delete_batch,\n  payment.live_gift_completed)\n  \u2014 NOT a domain event bus / not EventEmitter\n  as architecture between modules.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
